        "description": "Marcel is an application that lets you turn your life into a game by transforming tasks and habits into adventures. You can gain gold experience and rewards by achieving your tasks, being productive and accomplishing your overdue habits you didn’t do for weeks.",
        "techStack": [
            "Svelte",
            "Go",
            "Postgres",
            "Figma"
        ],
        "date": "2025",
        "challenge": "Turn a to-do list into something people actually want to open — habits, streaks and overdue tasks had to feel like a quest, not a chore.",
