            "camille",
            "mazouz"
        ],
        "notes": [
            "The reward loop was the whole design problem: gold and experience had to land the moment a task is checked, or the game falls apart.",
            "Everything was drawn in Figma before a single component was written, so the Svelte build stayed a translation job rather than a discovery one."
        ],
