        "description": "Projet Zero is a sci-fi RPG Minecraft server: you're a human soldier-astronaut holding the line against an alien civilisation whose technology dwarfs ours, all of it drawn from a strange ancient blue energy. We built the brand, the showcase website, the shop and the chapter (battle pass) info page from scratch.",
