            "noah"
        ],
        "notes": [
            "The logo had to read as an ancient artifact and a UI mark at the same time, so every iteration was tested small — favicon-small — before it was tested big.",
            "Blue carries the entire lore: it's the alien energy source, so every glow, every rarity tier and every chapter reward reuses the same handful of blues on purpose."
        ],
